    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 30.</p><p><strong>Spell Overload.</strong> When you cast a spell that deals damage with a spell slot, you can make its magical energy surge: you can treat any 1 or 2 on a damage die rolled for the spell as a 3, and the creatures that took damage from the spell also have the Prone condition. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you roll Initiative or finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
